  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency assistance for protecting agriculture-livelihoods and rebuilding coping capacities of vulnerable and food insecure farming households to shocks including COVID-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide time-critical assistance to 24 000 vulnerable smallholder farming and herding households by providing agricultural-livelihood safeguarding inputs as well as vulnerable landless and women-headed households by providing cash-based activities and nutrition assistance.</narrative>
